    "changes": "JS device commands aligned with upstream Celio. Explicit-start room-based relay transport derived from liru55 link-session.js (MPL-2.0). Transport has no ROM/save/storage API. Pre-link durable snapshots and interrupted-session rollback remain in the AGPL app; device logic retains GPL-3.0-only. Legacy direct WebRTC module is not used by the UI. Modified 2026-10-12: new/legacy transport detection, batched packets, command/session ACKs, bounded duplicate-safe retries. No automatic reconnect; interrupted sessions roll back.",
